<title>SWITZERLAND: CYCLING-TOUR OF SWITZERLAND FOURTH STAGE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-TOUR OF SWITZERLAND FOURTH STAGE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>KANDERSTEG, Switzerland 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading placings</p>
<p>in the 183-km fourth stage of the Tour of Switzerland from La</p>
<p>Chaux de Fonds on Friday:</p>
<p> 1. Jan Ullrich (Germany)    four hours 26 minutes 23 seconds</p>
<p> 2. Stefano Garzelli (Italy)	  38 seconds behind</p>
<p> 3. Roland Meier (Switzerland)	same time</p>
<p> 4. Michele Bartoli (Italy)	   1:08</p>
